      "side": 1,
      "message": "This will be helpful for some collection management patterns in Graphite where a list gets appended to a larger collection and then reset, but I\u0027m open to other approaches or changing function names to clarify things.",
      "revId": "3930aa0d2be0867ad61c0cca11693ea4aba3d85c",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "d1ef68e2_96e28b68",
        "filename": "include/private/base/SkTArray.h",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 366,
      "author": {
        "id": 11059
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-22T14:09:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Curious: would it be possible to allow the same semantics for `a.move_back(b)` without needing the extra `std::move`? \n\nThinking it through briefly, if we made this a `TArray\u0026`, then the only thing we\u0027ve lost is the ability to pass in a temporary here. We could probably add a `TArray\u0026\u0026` overload which just calls through to the `TArray\u0026` version. Any other caveats that I am missing?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 366,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 366,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "3930aa0d2be0867ad61c0cca11693ea4aba3d85c",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2747b7fc_e64c0d3d",
        "filename": "include/private/base/SkTArray.h",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 366,
      "author": {
        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-22T15:42:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, I think that\u0027s entirely reasonable to consider. I\u0027d used `TArray\u0026\u0026` to make calling call code use `std::move()`, which I find helps clarify at the call site that the input is being emptied, but happy to change it if you prefer TArray\u0026.",
      "parentUuid": "d1ef68e2_96e28b68",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 366,
        "startChar": 19,
        "endLine": 366,
        "endChar": 27
      },
      "revId": "3930aa0d2be0867ad61c0cca11693ea4aba3d85c",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "580d35ca_53d2e552",
        "filename": "include/private/base/SkTArray.h",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 366,
